pe\nORDER BY payment_type\nLIMIT 100;\n\nNote review may join orders? Not needed; order_payments order_id. Need only orders perhaps for validity? No.\n\nCould instead use EXISTS per payment type but not needed.\n\nEnsure \"每条评价在其订单使用的每种支付方式下各计一次\" yes distinct review per type.\n\nShould we include no review? Average score only reviews.\n\nFinal only SQL no fences."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2900,"completion_tokens":553,"total_tokens":3453,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":466},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1108},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}